{"unit_id":"BoWuGit__dsh-reasoning#feature-1","repo":"BoWuGit/dsh-reasoning","commit":"feacf2d769654c6c365787444b30d57d3e072411","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-reasoning 的功能「选择推理力度」：在 DSH Web 输入框使用 /reasoning 打开选项菜单，选择当前模型适配器提供的推理力度；没有显式默认值时还会提供 Default。选择后会以该力度重新选择当前模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:75-96","src/client/command.ts:57-76"]}
